    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n1474" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">affixĭō</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">adf-</span></b> ), ōnis,
			f.
		affigo, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a joining</i> or <i>fastening to</i>, <i>an addition</i> (only in late Lat.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">continua,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Non. 1, 327</span></i>
			.—Hence, <i>a zealous</i>, <i>ardent attachment to a thing</i>: philologiae,
			Capell. 1, p. 14.</div>
